  "findings": [
    "Seed100 satisfies geometric insertion but fails unchanged velocity-based stability: final 0.02059 m/s and 0.54740 rad/s while consecutive pose changes are 0.300 micrometre / 2.218 microradian. No substep data was recorded, so aliased intra-step motion vs physics velocity inconsistency cannot be resolved.",
    "Seed101 has residual entry interference, head Z about -3.775 mm, channel margin -0.394 mm, and negligible depth.",
    "Both V2 attempts remain bounded: seed100 completes backout/realign/reinsert and fails verify; seed101 completes backout/realign and fails reinsert.",
    "Installed gripper target range is -10 to +40 mm per finger. Action -1 drives -10 mm while held finger positions are around +16/+19 mm, with observed finger loads around26/29 N. Closing overdrive is a plausible contributor to high reported velocities, not a proved cause."
  ],
